\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico's New Peso Hits New Low Vs. Dlr At 7.0250 \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 18:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (AP-DJ)--Mexico's new peso hit a historic intraday low against the dollar in light, nervous trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  In Mexico City around 1700 GMT, on spot and 24-hour dollar markets, the dollar was trading at mid rate levels of 6.6800 new pesos per dollar against 6.3050 new pesos per dollar at Friday's close. Spreads widened to 6.6300/6.7300 new pesos per dollar. \par \par \uc2  One bank briefly quoted the dollar at a mid rate of 7.0250 pesos/dlr around 1630 GMT before the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regained some lost ground. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market closes at 1930 GMT. \par \par \uc2  The dollar hit a previous intraday high of 6.5500 new pesos per dlr Jan. 30. \par \par \uc2  Traders said activity was light, and it appeared \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'It's very thin, and with $10 or $20 million you can really move the market,' said one Mexico City trader, adding that the absence of any positive news on the economic and political fronts was hurting the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  A trader in New York said the peso was taking a beating in light trading as investors scrambled to convert the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  into German and Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The U.S. dollar was again being bruised against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in early trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  The trader added there continued to be concern about Mexico's economic and political stability. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-03-95 \par \par \uc2  1704GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3601lsf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
