\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico Peso Crisis/Amplifier -4: Commercial Credit At 80% \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Januar 1995\par 23:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Indeed, bankers say commercial credit isn't even available at the moment beyond 90 days and then only at rates at around 80%. \par \par \uc2  Worrisome too was the inability Tuesday of the new peso to hold on to Monday's gains, won with the help of New York Federal Reserve \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's account. Rumors of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  swirled, but were never confirmed. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not return press calls. \par \par \uc2  If the new peso doesn't revalue soon, Mexico may have to rethink its only days-old 1995 economic forecasts, analysts say. Mexico's current 1995 growth prediction of 1.5% and inflation target of 19% depends on a dollar at 4.5000 new pesos. \par \par \uc2  'Some of the growth rates and inflation assumptions in the government's plans may be optimistic and could pose hallenges to the successful implementation of (the government's emergency economic) package,' wrote Duff & Phelps. \par \par \uc2  Though analysts agree that the new peso may be undervalued, they see no reason to buy peso-denominated anything until a solid floor is touched. \par \par \uc2  Finally, the markets had to contend Tuesday with word that 800 angry peasants blocked one of the key highways in the troubled southern state of Chiapas. A New Year's 1994 uprising in Chiapas threatened to break out anew last month, in part causing the flight of foreign investment that toyuched off Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis. \par \par \uc2  'Beautiful, that's just what I needed,' said a young Mexican broker who said he couldn't interest one new customer all day. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-01-95 \par \par \uc2  2205GMT \par \par \uc2  1137 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr1a0033d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
